1
00:01:43,400 --> 00:01:46,900
"The Missing Piece"

2
00:01:47,100 --> 00:01:51,800
(Episode 2)

3
00:01:57,760 --> 00:01:58,760
Shen Mo.

4
00:01:59,519 --> 00:02:00,519
You...

5
00:02:00,560 --> 00:02:01,879
What happened to your lip?

6
00:02:06,680 --> 00:02:07,439
Nothing.

7
00:02:07,440 --> 00:02:09,120
I accidentally bumped it yesterday.

8
00:02:11,199 --> 00:02:12,199
Really?

9
00:02:12,479 --> 00:02:15,280
That doesn't look like it came from a fall.

10
00:02:15,479 --> 00:02:16,479
It looks like...

11
00:02:17,319 --> 00:02:18,319
An'an.

12
00:02:19,000 --> 00:02:20,000
Eat your breakfast.

13
00:02:21,120 --> 00:02:22,120
Okay.

14
00:02:22,280 --> 00:02:23,718
It's grown-up business.

15
00:02:23,719 --> 00:02:25,319
I'm just a kid, so I won't ask.

16
00:02:26,680 --> 00:02:27,680
An'an.

17
00:02:27,919 --> 00:02:29,159
What are you doing today?

18
00:02:29,759 --> 00:02:31,199
I have a job interview.

19
00:02:31,439 --> 00:02:32,840
Why look for a job somewhere else?

20
00:02:32,919 --> 00:02:34,679
Wouldn't it be better
to work at my company?

21
00:02:35,639 --> 00:02:37,159
I'm not Shen Mo.

22
00:02:37,719 --> 00:02:39,639
I don't want to be around you all day.

23
00:02:45,960 --> 00:02:46,960
Hello?

24
00:02:48,000 --> 00:02:48,719
Yeah.

25
00:02:48,919 --> 00:02:49,919
I'm done eating.

26
00:02:50,000 --> 00:02:50,520
Okay.

27
00:02:51,000 --> 00:02:52,199
I'll come down now.

28
00:02:54,439 --> 00:02:55,439
Looks like...

29
00:02:55,599 --> 00:02:57,719
the person you do want to be around all day

30
00:02:58,680 --> 00:02:59,680
is here to pick you up.

31
00:03:01,360 --> 00:03:03,080
You're one to talk.

32
00:03:04,319 --> 00:03:05,319
Bye.

33
00:03:09,199 --> 00:03:12,639
It used to be that he would
pick me up like that too.

34
00:03:17,919 --> 00:03:19,199
Does your lip still hurt?

35
00:03:20,919 --> 00:03:21,919
No.

36
00:03:28,759 --> 00:03:29,759
Mr. Ji.

37
00:03:32,199 --> 00:03:33,199
Let me disinfect it.

38
00:03:34,280 --> 00:03:35,280
All done.

39
00:03:35,719 --> 00:03:36,800
I need to get to work.

40
00:03:37,280 --> 00:03:38,280
I'll drive you.

41
00:03:42,199 --> 00:03:44,319
I can never figure Mr. Ji out.

42
00:03:45,000 --> 00:03:46,599
One moment, he's laughing and joking.

43
00:03:47,000 --> 00:03:48,800
The next, he turns cold and ruthless.

44
00:03:49,479 --> 00:03:51,039
And I have no other choice

45
00:03:51,319 --> 00:03:52,560
but to behave myself

46
00:03:52,960 --> 00:03:54,319
and obediently do as I'm told.

47
00:04:04,800 --> 00:04:05,800
Mr. Ji.

48
00:04:06,000 --> 00:04:07,479
Why don't you go up first?

49
00:04:08,319 --> 00:04:09,479
I'll head in later.

50
00:04:10,560 --> 00:04:11,560
Why are you hiding?

51
00:04:11,960 --> 00:04:13,919
When you were with Zhou Yang,

52
00:04:14,280 --> 00:04:16,600
you weren't afraid of anyone's gossip.

53
00:04:17,839 --> 00:04:19,319
But now that you're with me,

54
00:04:20,319 --> 00:04:21,759
you're desperate to avoid suspicion.

55
00:04:22,079 --> 00:04:23,079
That's different.

56
00:04:25,079 --> 00:04:26,240
You're the boss.

57
00:04:27,240 --> 00:04:28,240
So what?

58
00:04:29,560 --> 00:04:30,600
Who cares?

59
00:05:03,240 --> 00:05:04,920
Mr. Ji is holding his hand in public!

60
00:05:05,079 --> 00:05:06,999
He's not even trying to hide it.

61
00:05:07,000 --> 00:05:08,518
I've never seen Mr. Ji

62
00:05:08,519 --> 00:05:09,439
care this much about anyone.

63
00:05:09,440 --> 00:05:11,120
He's clearly on a whole different level.

64
00:05:11,319 --> 00:05:12,599
Now everyone can see

65
00:05:12,600 --> 00:05:13,679
there's something special between them.

66
00:05:13,680 --> 00:05:14,079
Oh, my God.

67
00:05:14,080 --> 00:05:15,398
Just think how many

68
00:05:15,399 --> 00:05:17,039
of Mr. Ji's admirers will be heartbroken.

69
00:05:17,120 --> 00:05:18,120
Exactly.

70
00:05:26,959 --> 00:05:28,079
Starting today,

71
00:05:28,720 --> 00:05:30,360
you won't be working at the desk outside.

72
00:05:30,879 --> 00:05:31,959
You'll stay in this office

73
00:05:32,279 --> 00:05:33,879
and work here with me.

74
00:05:34,839 --> 00:05:35,839
Mr. Ji.

75
00:05:36,279 --> 00:05:37,399
Isn't that inappropriate?

76
00:05:37,720 --> 00:05:39,319
Everyone's already talking.

77
00:05:42,560 --> 00:05:43,959
You're working for me either way.

78
00:05:44,399 --> 00:05:46,199
What difference does it make where you sit?

79
00:05:47,800 --> 00:05:49,439
What's inappropriate about it?

80
00:05:51,199 --> 00:05:52,399
He's always been like this,

81
00:05:52,759 --> 00:05:54,679
controlling every part
of my life as he pleases,

82
00:05:55,040 --> 00:05:58,199
leaving me alone to endure
the humiliation and gossip.

83
00:06:06,279 --> 00:06:07,279
Shen Mo.

84
00:06:08,079 --> 00:06:09,240
Are you free this afternoon?

85
00:06:09,439 --> 00:06:10,240
Why?

86
00:06:10,439 --> 00:06:11,519
I've got nothing important.

87
00:06:12,759 --> 00:06:14,959
Zhou Yang's birthday
is in a couple of days.

88
00:06:15,079 --> 00:06:16,919
I want to pick out a
birthday present for him.

89
00:06:16,959 --> 00:06:18,199
Will you come with me?

90
00:06:19,480 --> 00:06:21,240
I don't know Zhou Yang that well.

91
00:06:21,560 --> 00:06:23,240
I doubt I'll be much help.

92
00:06:24,639 --> 00:06:26,199
Just come keep me company.

93
00:06:26,399 --> 00:06:28,160
I'm terrible at picking out gifts.

94
00:06:28,319 --> 00:06:30,318
Every time I have to choose one,

95
00:06:30,319 --> 00:06:31,680
I rack my brain over it.

96
00:06:32,319 --> 00:06:33,999
Besides, you two went
to high school together.

97
00:06:34,000 --> 00:06:35,600
I'm sure you can help me.

98
00:06:36,120 --> 00:06:37,800
I really don't know how to pick gifts.

99
00:06:39,560 --> 00:06:41,239
Shen Mo, please!

100
00:06:41,240 --> 00:06:43,160
Just come keep me company.

101
00:06:43,519 --> 00:06:45,879
I just got back from abroad
and don't have any friends.

102
00:06:46,160 --> 00:06:48,240
You wouldn't make me go alone, would you?

103
00:06:48,279 --> 00:06:49,279
Okay, okay.

104
00:06:49,280 --> 00:06:50,560
I'll go with you.

105
00:06:51,000 --> 00:06:51,519
Yes!

106
00:06:51,639 --> 00:06:52,680
Thank you, Shen Mo.

107
00:06:53,040 --> 00:06:53,800
You're the best.

108
00:06:53,801 --> 00:06:55,319
No wonder my brother likes you.

109
00:06:57,279 --> 00:06:58,000
Come on.

110
00:06:58,001 --> 00:06:59,279
I'm not that lucky.

111
00:06:59,920 --> 00:07:01,199
I wish he really did like me.

112
00:07:01,399 --> 00:07:02,399
What?

113
00:07:02,519 --> 00:07:02,839
Nothing.

114
00:07:02,839 --> 00:07:03,800
It's nothing.

115
00:07:03,800 --> 00:07:04,800
Let's go.

116
00:07:04,959 --> 00:07:05,399
Okay.

117
00:07:05,600 --> 00:07:06,199
I'll go change.

118
00:07:06,199 --> 00:07:07,199
Wait for me.

119
00:07:17,360 --> 00:07:18,360
How about this one?

120
00:07:19,360 --> 00:07:21,600
Shen Mo, take another look for me.

121
00:07:23,920 --> 00:07:25,079
This one's nice.

122
00:07:25,480 --> 00:07:27,120
The material feels good too.

123
00:07:27,879 --> 00:07:28,879
Then I'll take it.

124
00:07:29,879 --> 00:07:31,119
That tie is nice too.

125
00:07:31,120 --> 00:07:32,398
Please wrap them both.

126
00:07:32,399 --> 00:07:32,720
Of course.

127
00:07:32,721 --> 00:07:34,040
I'll wrap them together for you.

128
00:07:34,199 --> 00:07:35,920
But I feel like

129
00:07:36,360 --> 00:07:39,439
Zhou Yang already has all of these.

130
00:07:40,519 --> 00:07:41,919
Do you have anything new?

131
00:07:41,920 --> 00:07:43,240
We do. One moment.

132
00:07:44,920 --> 00:07:46,198
These two cuff links just came in.

133
00:07:46,199 --> 00:07:47,199
Feel free to take a look.

134
00:07:51,480 --> 00:07:52,560
This one's nice.

135
00:07:53,800 --> 00:07:54,800
They're both nice.

136
00:07:54,800 --> 00:07:55,800
It's so hard to choose.

137
00:07:57,000 --> 00:07:58,078
This pair is more understated.

138
00:07:58,079 --> 00:07:59,319
This pair is more stylish.

139
00:08:00,959 --> 00:08:02,078
Then wrap them both.

140
00:08:02,079 --> 00:08:03,079
Of course.

141
00:08:04,800 --> 00:08:05,399
Perfect.

142
00:08:05,400 --> 00:08:07,000
I can give the other pair to my brother.

143
00:08:08,399 --> 00:08:10,519
Now that we've bought
the gifts, I can relax.

144
00:08:11,240 --> 00:08:11,959
Shen Mo.

145
00:08:11,959 --> 00:08:12,240
Yeah?

146
00:08:12,241 --> 00:08:13,639
How about we go eat?

147
00:08:13,920 --> 00:08:16,680
Let's go to that restaurant
you and my brother always visit.

148
00:08:18,160 --> 00:08:19,160
What?

149
00:08:19,480 --> 00:08:21,198
Back when I was abroad,

150
00:08:21,199 --> 00:08:22,479
my brother was always bragging to me

151
00:08:22,480 --> 00:08:24,319
about going to Nianwei Restaurant with you.

152
00:08:24,519 --> 00:08:25,720
Let's go, Shen Mo.

153
00:08:26,160 --> 00:08:27,240
Nianwei Restaurant?

154
00:08:29,600 --> 00:08:31,560
I've never been there with him.

155
00:08:31,800 --> 00:08:34,679
I guess the person he always
talked about taking there

156
00:08:35,600 --> 00:08:36,960
was never me.

157
00:08:41,720 --> 00:08:43,879
I've clearly never been here before.

158
00:08:44,559 --> 00:08:45,839
So why does it feel so familiar?

159
00:08:46,279 --> 00:08:47,519
What's wrong, Shen Mo?

160
00:08:47,559 --> 00:08:48,360
Are you feeling sick?

161
00:08:48,480 --> 00:08:49,480
I'm fine.

162
00:08:52,679 --> 00:08:53,679
Hello.

163
00:08:53,840 --> 00:08:55,039
Do you have a reservation?

164
00:08:55,679 --> 00:08:56,200
No.

165
00:08:56,399 --> 00:08:58,079
But I'm Ji Mingxuan's sister.

166
00:08:58,080 --> 00:08:59,080
Can we use his name?

167
00:08:59,320 --> 00:09:00,320
Of course.

168
00:09:00,360 --> 00:09:01,879
Mr. Ji is one of our VIPs.

169
00:09:02,039 --> 00:09:03,079
But we'll need to check

170
00:09:03,080 --> 00:09:04,560
whether we have any tables available.

171
00:09:04,720 --> 00:09:05,159
Okay.

172
00:09:05,360 --> 00:09:06,360
Thank you.

173
00:09:08,320 --> 00:09:10,440
It really is that goofball Wang Qing.

174
00:09:11,559 --> 00:09:12,240
Mingxuan!

175
00:09:12,519 --> 00:09:13,840
Are you two eating here too?

176
00:09:14,679 --> 00:09:15,960
What are you two doing here?

177
00:09:17,039 --> 00:09:18,999
You're always busy with work,

178
00:09:19,000 --> 00:09:20,960
so I had to ask Shen Mo to come with me.

179
00:09:22,000 --> 00:09:23,720
But we don't have a reservation.

180
00:09:24,120 --> 00:09:25,120
Don't worry.

181
00:09:25,240 --> 00:09:26,600
I won't let you go hungry.

182
00:09:29,000 --> 00:09:31,279
I guess only someone
like that is worthy of Mr. Ji.

183
00:09:31,304 --> 00:09:32,647
[Zhao Yi]

184
00:09:32,759 --> 00:09:34,759
I'm only fit to be Mr. Ji's plaything.

185
00:09:38,360 --> 00:09:39,816
You don't mind eating together, do you?

186
00:09:39,840 --> 00:09:40,960
Of course not.

187
00:09:41,840 --> 00:09:43,320
This way, Mr. Ji.

188
00:09:50,120 --> 00:09:51,919
Aren't you going to introduce us, Mr. Ji?

189
00:09:53,200 --> 00:09:54,200
My sister.

190
00:09:55,799 --> 00:09:57,039
So you're Miss Ji.

191
00:09:57,639 --> 00:10:00,480
And is this gentleman your boyfriend?

192
00:10:01,320 --> 00:10:02,320
No.

193
00:10:02,440 --> 00:10:03,240
You've got it wrong.

194
00:10:03,241 --> 00:10:04,759
He's the future Mrs. Ji.

195
00:10:10,120 --> 00:10:11,399
Mr. Ji, you must be joking.

196
00:10:11,919 --> 00:10:13,200
I've already ordered.

197
00:10:13,759 --> 00:10:15,159
Miss Ji, can you handle spicy food?

198
00:10:15,799 --> 00:10:17,039
Yes, I can.

199
00:10:18,120 --> 00:10:19,518
And what about the future Mrs. Ji?

200
00:10:19,519 --> 00:10:20,559
Can you handle spicy food?

201
00:10:20,840 --> 00:10:21,840
He loves spicy food.

202
00:10:22,360 --> 00:10:23,360
Don't worry.

203
00:10:24,840 --> 00:10:26,159
Future Mrs. Ji, my ass.

204
00:10:26,559 --> 00:10:28,840
He just used a contract
to keep me tied to him.

205
00:10:29,120 --> 00:10:31,279
For his sister's happiness,

206
00:10:31,440 --> 00:10:33,560
I wouldn't be surprised if
he called me his ancestor.

207
00:10:33,720 --> 00:10:36,039
If Zhou Yang had other lovers,

208
00:10:36,320 --> 00:10:38,056
who knows how far Ji
Mingxuan would go for his sister

209
00:10:38,080 --> 00:10:40,240
or how many more future
spouses he'd claim to have.

210
00:11:00,000 --> 00:11:01,000
Zhou Yang.

211
00:11:01,200 --> 00:11:02,320
You're so sweet.

212
00:11:03,879 --> 00:11:05,759
Have Zhou Yang and I been here before?

213
00:11:09,360 --> 00:11:10,360
Yes.

214
00:11:11,039 --> 00:11:13,320
These are the dishes we used to eat.

215
00:11:17,480 --> 00:11:18,480
An'an.

216
00:11:19,679 --> 00:11:21,080
How was shopping today?

217
00:11:23,200 --> 00:11:24,895
Zhou Yang's birthday
is in a couple of days.

218
00:11:24,919 --> 00:11:27,039
We went to buy him a
birthday present today.

219
00:11:27,120 --> 00:11:29,120
Shen Mo was a big help picking it out.

220
00:11:29,679 --> 00:11:31,320
So you were buying Zhou Yang a gift.

221
00:11:32,200 --> 00:11:33,440
All right, all right.

222
00:11:33,480 --> 00:11:35,120
I got you something too.

223
00:11:35,639 --> 00:11:36,639
Honestly.

224
00:11:38,240 --> 00:11:39,960
Shen Mo picked this out especially for you.

225
00:11:55,080 --> 00:11:56,639
You have excellent taste, Mr. Shen.

226
00:11:57,919 --> 00:11:58,919
It's all right.

227
00:12:02,840 --> 00:12:03,639
By the way,

228
00:12:03,639 --> 00:12:04,399
Shen Mo,

229
00:12:04,400 --> 00:12:05,840
when's your birthday?

230
00:12:06,799 --> 00:12:07,840
November 12th.

231
00:12:10,879 --> 00:12:11,519
Okay.

232
00:12:11,840 --> 00:12:12,840
I'll remember that.

233
00:12:13,480 --> 00:12:14,520
I'm going to the restroom.

234
00:12:20,440 --> 00:12:21,440
Hello?

235
00:12:24,559 --> 00:12:25,559
I need to take this call.

236
00:12:31,240 --> 00:12:33,240
Is the food not to your liking today?

237
00:12:33,399 --> 00:12:35,119
You don't seem to be eating much, Mr. Shen.

238
00:12:36,080 --> 00:12:37,080
No.

239
00:12:37,759 --> 00:12:39,200
I just don't eat much.

240
00:12:44,759 --> 00:12:46,360
The one Mr. Ji is wearing

241
00:12:46,679 --> 00:12:48,399
looks like the same ring.

242
00:12:50,240 --> 00:12:51,240
Yeah.

243
00:12:51,559 --> 00:12:52,638
Mr. Shen, do you live

244
00:12:52,639 --> 00:12:54,199
in that house at Jinxiu Mountain Villa?

245
00:12:56,240 --> 00:12:57,360
Jinxiu Mountain Villa?

246
00:12:57,480 --> 00:12:58,480
No.

247
00:12:58,639 --> 00:13:00,279
Why do you ask, Mr. Zhao?

248
00:13:01,759 --> 00:13:02,759
It's nothing.

249
00:13:02,919 --> 00:13:04,159
I mistook you for someone else.

250
00:13:05,559 --> 00:13:08,079
The one living at Jinxiu Mountain
Villa must be his real lover.

251
00:13:08,639 --> 00:13:10,159
I'm just someone he hired.

252
00:13:10,919 --> 00:13:12,159
Zhao Yi probably thinks

253
00:13:12,759 --> 00:13:15,080
I'm not even worthy of being his rival.

254
00:13:25,279 --> 00:13:26,279
Mr. Ji.

255
00:13:27,279 --> 00:13:28,279
What is it?

256
00:13:29,480 --> 00:13:30,480
Nothing.

257
00:13:32,240 --> 00:13:33,600
Zhou Yang's birthday is coming up.

258
00:13:35,600 --> 00:13:36,600
Yeah.

259
00:13:37,200 --> 00:13:39,200
You remember Zhou Yang's
birthday well, don't you?

260
00:13:39,759 --> 00:13:40,759
I...

261
00:13:41,759 --> 00:13:43,000
What about your own birthday?

262
00:13:43,360 --> 00:13:44,360
November 12th.

263
00:13:44,360 --> 00:13:45,360
What about mine?

264
00:13:49,679 --> 00:13:50,879
I knew you wouldn't remember.

265
00:13:51,559 --> 00:13:53,000
I didn't expect you to, anyway.

266
00:13:53,759 --> 00:13:55,119
I still have to take Zhao Yi home.

267
00:13:55,399 --> 00:13:56,399
You two go on ahead.

268
00:13:58,600 --> 00:14:00,279
I doubt he'd care anyway.

269
00:14:01,000 --> 00:14:03,000
There are always people
around who care about him.

270
00:14:03,120 --> 00:14:05,799
One less person won't make any difference.

271
00:14:06,399 --> 00:14:08,039
But as his contract lover,

272
00:14:08,600 --> 00:14:10,720
maybe I'm doing a terrible job.

273
00:14:29,519 --> 00:14:30,519
An'an.

274
00:14:30,879 --> 00:14:31,879
Yeah?

275
00:14:31,919 --> 00:14:32,919
Um...

276
00:14:34,240 --> 00:14:36,320
What birthday gift are
you getting Mingxuan?

277
00:14:37,559 --> 00:14:38,080
Why?

278
00:14:38,279 --> 00:14:39,638
Are you already thinking about

279
00:14:39,639 --> 00:14:41,000
getting him a birthday gift?

280
00:14:43,240 --> 00:14:44,240
I guess.

281
00:14:45,600 --> 00:14:46,360
It's not that early, is it?

282
00:14:46,361 --> 00:14:47,960
I just want to prepare ahead of time.

283
00:14:48,759 --> 00:14:49,879
It's way too early.

284
00:14:50,080 --> 00:14:51,976
My brother's birthday is
at the Beginning of Spring.

285
00:14:52,000 --> 00:14:53,480
I haven't even thought about it yet.

286
00:14:53,919 --> 00:14:55,559
It's fine. I was just asking.

287
00:14:57,720 --> 00:14:58,720
The Beginning of Spring.

288
00:14:59,360 --> 00:15:00,560
So it's that easy to remember.

289
00:15:01,279 --> 00:15:03,439
He could tell me my birthday
without a second thought,

290
00:15:03,519 --> 00:15:04,919
but I didn't even know his.

291
00:15:05,840 --> 00:15:07,160
He already has everything I have.

292
00:15:08,000 --> 00:15:09,680
And I can't give him what he doesn't have.

293
00:15:10,559 --> 00:15:13,600
Even I belong to him now.

294
00:15:14,360 --> 00:15:15,600
What could I possibly give him?

295
00:15:22,200 --> 00:15:24,600
Did my brother leave early again?

296
00:15:25,360 --> 00:15:26,360
No.

297
00:15:26,600 --> 00:15:28,600
He never came home last night.

298
00:15:30,320 --> 00:15:31,320
Oh.

299
00:15:31,759 --> 00:15:32,759
Okay.

300
00:15:32,840 --> 00:15:34,240
Has work been that busy lately?

301
00:15:36,879 --> 00:15:37,879
Whoa!

302
00:15:38,240 --> 00:15:39,999
That Zhao Yi really is a celebrity.

303
00:15:40,000 --> 00:15:41,000
Look.

304
00:15:41,159 --> 00:15:44,279
Paparazzi caught him
meeting a man late at night.

305
00:15:45,720 --> 00:15:47,080
Could it be Mr. Ji?

306
00:15:49,200 --> 00:15:50,240
That's not my brother.

307
00:15:52,720 --> 00:15:54,200
Don't worry, Shen Mo.

308
00:15:54,480 --> 00:15:56,679
My brother was obviously
just working with him.

309
00:15:56,879 --> 00:15:58,440
They're probably just friends.

310
00:16:00,240 --> 00:16:01,600
Of course I'm not worried.

311
00:16:02,519 --> 00:16:04,079
And even if it was Mr. Ji,

312
00:16:04,080 --> 00:16:05,840
I trust that he wouldn't do anything.

313
00:16:06,519 --> 00:16:07,519
Okay.

314
00:16:08,320 --> 00:16:09,000
I'm a little tired.

315
00:16:09,001 --> 00:16:10,120
I'm going to get some rest.

316
00:16:31,840 --> 00:16:33,159
I couldn't reach you by phone.

317
00:16:33,320 --> 00:16:34,760
I know you'll probably turn me down,

318
00:16:34,840 --> 00:16:35,919
but I still have to ask.

319
00:16:36,279 --> 00:16:37,879
Want to come to a party with me tonight?

320
00:16:39,159 --> 00:16:40,159
Sure.

321
00:16:45,639 --> 00:16:46,639
That was easy.

322
00:16:47,559 --> 00:16:48,559
Are we going or not?

323
00:16:58,480 --> 00:16:59,559
Shen Mo, Shen Mo.

324
00:17:00,240 --> 00:17:02,240
You've never been as good as anyone else,

325
00:17:03,200 --> 00:17:04,920
and now, even as someone's lover,

326
00:17:05,359 --> 00:17:06,519
you're dead last.

327
00:17:08,000 --> 00:17:09,000
Pathetic.

328
00:17:15,640 --> 00:17:16,160
Let's go.

329
00:17:16,400 --> 00:17:17,599
Stop, stop, stop!

330
00:17:17,839 --> 00:17:18,839
Perfect.

331
00:17:19,359 --> 00:17:20,160
Well, well.

332
00:17:20,200 --> 00:17:22,200
The famous Zhao Yi brought his man today.

333
00:17:23,880 --> 00:17:24,720
Don't talk nonsense.

334
00:17:24,880 --> 00:17:26,480
Ji Mingxuan, CEO Ji.

335
00:17:27,960 --> 00:17:30,118
We all know CEO Ji.

336
00:17:30,119 --> 00:17:33,079
Weren't you two in the news a few days ago?

337
00:17:36,960 --> 00:17:38,599
Look, even CEO Ji isn't denying it.

338
00:17:38,759 --> 00:17:39,880
What more is there to say?

339
00:17:44,599 --> 00:17:45,720
You should drink less.

340
00:17:50,279 --> 00:17:51,279
It's fine.

341
00:18:02,480 --> 00:18:03,200
Shen Mo.

342
00:18:03,440 --> 00:18:04,680
How did you get my number?

343
00:18:05,400 --> 00:18:06,480
An'an gave it to me.

344
00:18:06,759 --> 00:18:07,839
Come over to the window.

345
00:18:16,480 --> 00:18:17,480
Are you crazy?

346
00:18:17,519 --> 00:18:18,759
How dare you come here?

347
00:18:19,039 --> 00:18:20,039
Leave right now.

348
00:18:20,599 --> 00:18:22,399
I'll leave once I've
said what I came to say.

349
00:18:22,880 --> 00:18:23,959
I've heard some rumors.

350
00:18:23,960 --> 00:18:25,200
They're about Ji Mingxuan.

351
00:18:25,359 --> 00:18:26,960
About Mingxuan and Zhao Yi?

352
00:18:27,559 --> 00:18:28,598
I heard about that too.

353
00:18:28,599 --> 00:18:29,880
But it's all a misunderstanding.

354
00:18:30,960 --> 00:18:32,640
I know more than that.

355
00:18:32,880 --> 00:18:33,880
What?

356
00:18:34,039 --> 00:18:35,960
Are you going to sell
the story to a tabloid?

357
00:18:39,440 --> 00:18:40,440
Shen Mo.

358
00:18:41,319 --> 00:18:42,440
I want to see you.

359
00:18:42,640 --> 00:18:43,880
I already told you.

360
00:18:44,319 --> 00:18:45,920
We're never meeting alone again.

361
00:18:46,880 --> 00:18:48,519
If you were happy with Ji Mingxuan,

362
00:18:48,559 --> 00:18:49,759
I could stay out of your life.

363
00:18:49,880 --> 00:18:51,239
But you're not.

364
00:18:51,240 --> 00:18:52,599
An'an told me.

365
00:18:52,920 --> 00:18:54,759
You're only with him to repay him.

366
00:18:55,359 --> 00:18:56,359
Yes.

367
00:18:56,680 --> 00:18:57,920
Mingxuan did save me once.

368
00:18:58,960 --> 00:19:00,559
But that was only how we met.

369
00:19:01,559 --> 00:19:03,559
We're together because
we truly love each other.

370
00:19:04,240 --> 00:19:05,240
Otherwise,

371
00:19:06,400 --> 00:19:08,055
how could two people with
no feelings for each other

372
00:19:08,079 --> 00:19:11,079
possibly live together
every day for three years?

373
00:19:12,000 --> 00:19:13,000
Shen Mo.

374
00:19:13,480 --> 00:19:14,680
I just want to see you once.

375
00:19:15,440 --> 00:19:16,495
What difference would that make?

376
00:19:16,519 --> 00:19:17,559
I can take you away.

377
00:19:17,960 --> 00:19:18,999
Grow up.

378
00:19:19,000 --> 00:19:20,559
You're the Zhou family's only son.

379
00:19:22,279 --> 00:19:23,759
Your parents would never agree to it.

380
00:19:24,160 --> 00:19:26,039
It doesn't matter if they don't.

381
00:19:26,200 --> 00:19:27,759
I didn't join my father's company.

382
00:19:28,119 --> 00:19:29,640
I've started my own business.

383
00:19:30,160 --> 00:19:31,200
What about Miss Ji?

384
00:19:32,440 --> 00:19:32,960
An'an...

385
00:19:33,440 --> 00:19:35,200
I'll explain everything to An'an.

386
00:19:35,920 --> 00:19:36,920
Go.

387
00:19:36,960 --> 00:19:37,960
Shen Mo.

388
00:19:39,519 --> 00:19:41,160
Do you remember our first date?

389
00:19:41,559 --> 00:19:42,799
It was at Tianhe Park.

390
00:19:43,640 --> 00:19:45,240
We were still in high school.

391
00:19:46,000 --> 00:19:48,240
We foolishly went to see the plum blossoms

392
00:19:48,720 --> 00:19:50,480
and missed our stop on the bus.

393
00:19:52,519 --> 00:19:53,519
Shen Mo.

394
00:19:56,519 --> 00:19:58,239
I'll wait for you at our old spot tomorrow.

395
00:20:00,079 --> 00:20:01,079
We...

396
00:20:02,319 --> 00:20:03,559
Let's start over.

397
00:20:07,960 --> 00:20:09,039
I have work tomorrow.

398
00:20:25,440 --> 00:20:28,799
Will Mr. Ji be coming home tonight?

399
00:20:30,440 --> 00:20:32,160
Looks like CEO Ji enjoys drinking.

400
00:20:32,519 --> 00:20:33,679
Then let's have a few drinks.

401
00:20:33,799 --> 00:20:34,960
That might be a little...

402
00:20:35,319 --> 00:20:36,319
Sure.

403
00:22:19,039 --> 00:22:20,519
Once time has passed,

404
00:22:20,880 --> 00:22:22,079
there's no turning back.

405
00:22:23,359 --> 00:22:24,359
In this world,

406
00:22:24,440 --> 00:22:26,920
maybe many people can put
a broken relationship back together.

407
00:22:29,119 --> 00:22:30,119
But

408
00:22:30,200 --> 00:22:31,920
Zhou Yang and I never will.

409
00:22:58,960 --> 00:22:59,960
Mr. Ji.

410
00:23:01,119 --> 00:23:02,200
You're back.

411
00:23:03,119 --> 00:23:04,119
Shen Mo.

412
00:23:05,680 --> 00:23:06,680
It's me.

413
00:23:09,200 --> 00:23:10,279
Why are you here?

414
00:23:11,200 --> 00:23:12,880
I've always lived here.

415
00:23:35,960 --> 00:23:37,480
Mr. Ji, have you been drinking?

416
00:23:45,519 --> 00:23:47,160
I'll make you some honey water.

417
00:23:52,759 --> 00:23:53,759
Don't.

418
00:24:09,160 --> 00:24:10,160
Shen Mo.

419
00:24:22,319 --> 00:24:23,319
What's wrong,

420
00:24:24,440 --> 00:24:25,440
Mr. Ji?

421
00:24:26,240 --> 00:24:27,240
Don't go.

422
00:24:28,279 --> 00:24:29,759
I'm right here, Mr. Ji.

423
00:24:30,160 --> 00:24:31,640
I'm here.

424
00:25:15,839 --> 00:25:16,839
Shen Mo.

425
00:25:17,839 --> 00:25:18,839
Shen Mo.

426
00:25:19,200 --> 00:25:20,200
Come with me.

427
00:25:22,400 --> 00:25:23,400
Shen Mo.

428
00:25:25,039 --> 00:25:26,759
I'll wait for you at our old spot tomorrow.

429
00:25:38,759 --> 00:25:40,199
Stay in bed with me a little longer.

430
00:25:43,920 --> 00:25:44,920
You're awake.

431
00:25:45,880 --> 00:25:47,119
You drank too much last night.

432
00:25:48,480 --> 00:25:50,039
I still have to go to work.

433
00:25:51,039 --> 00:25:52,240
Then take another day off.

434
00:25:52,680 --> 00:25:54,359
How did you know I took yesterday off?

435
00:25:55,599 --> 00:25:58,000
Did you forget which company you work for?

436
00:26:01,440 --> 00:26:02,440
Give me your phone.

437
00:26:03,119 --> 00:26:04,480
I'll call in for you.

438
00:26:13,160 --> 00:26:14,160
It's turned off.

439
00:26:14,759 --> 00:26:15,759
Maybe

440
00:26:16,000 --> 00:26:17,240
I was too tired yesterday.

441
00:26:25,119 --> 00:26:26,920
Someone sent you a ton of texts.

442
00:26:28,400 --> 00:26:29,880
They're probably all spam.

443
00:26:30,839 --> 00:26:32,000
Want to check them?

444
00:26:33,240 --> 00:26:34,240
Just delete them all.

445
00:26:35,440 --> 00:26:36,440
Are you sure?

446
00:26:40,640 --> 00:26:41,640
Yeah.

447
00:26:44,200 --> 00:26:45,359
Don't regret it later.

448
00:26:49,839 --> 00:26:50,839
I won't.

449
00:26:59,119 --> 00:27:01,119
Maybe what I truly miss isn't Zhou Yang,

450
00:27:01,559 --> 00:27:03,839
but those wonderful days of our youth.

451
00:27:04,599 --> 00:27:06,039
But it's already been three years.

452
00:27:06,839 --> 00:27:08,599
It's time for everyone to move on.

453
00:27:09,240 --> 00:27:10,480
Shen Mo is taking the day off.

454
00:27:14,200 --> 00:27:15,640
Stay in bed with me a little longer.

455
00:27:44,599 --> 00:27:45,599
Mr. Ji.

456
00:27:46,440 --> 00:27:47,559
It's time for lunch.

457
00:27:54,119 --> 00:27:55,119
Mr. Ji?

458
00:27:55,480 --> 00:27:56,480
Mr. Ji!

459
00:28:07,279 --> 00:28:08,279
You have a fever.

460
00:29:00,440 --> 00:29:01,839
Mr. Ji has a fever.

461
00:29:03,480 --> 00:29:04,880
I'm just a little tired.

462
00:29:05,640 --> 00:29:06,976
Do you want to go to the hospital?

463
00:29:07,000 --> 00:29:08,000
No need.

464
00:29:08,720 --> 00:29:09,839
Then I'll call a doctor.

465
00:29:10,039 --> 00:29:11,200
It's nothing serious.

466
00:29:11,799 --> 00:29:12,839
Don't bother.

467
00:29:12,880 --> 00:29:13,880
But...

468
00:29:14,680 --> 00:29:15,680
Quiet.

469
00:29:16,559 --> 00:29:17,759
I'll be fine after some sleep.

470
00:29:26,920 --> 00:29:28,680
I never knew you were like this, Mr. Ji.

471
00:29:29,440 --> 00:29:31,240
You get sick and refuse to see a doctor.

472
00:29:32,960 --> 00:29:34,960
Did I wear you out so
much that you got sick?

473
00:29:49,759 --> 00:29:50,759
Shen Mo.

474
00:30:01,240 --> 00:30:02,640
I'm right here, Mr. Ji.

475
00:31:16,799 --> 00:31:17,279
Zhang.

476
00:31:17,280 --> 00:31:18,760
Can you take me to buy some medicine?

477
00:31:24,440 --> 00:31:27,119
Mr. Ji went to see someone last night.

478
00:31:27,599 --> 00:31:29,480
He was in a bad mood all day yesterday.

479
00:31:29,839 --> 00:31:31,440
Then he got completely wasted.

480
00:31:33,920 --> 00:31:35,640
Mr. Ji's shoes were soaked.

481
00:31:36,200 --> 00:31:37,440
Did he fall?

482
00:31:38,319 --> 00:31:39,319
Well...

483
00:31:39,400 --> 00:31:41,400
Mr. Ji insisted on going
to Jinxiu Mountain Villa.

484
00:31:44,359 --> 00:31:45,359
Jinxiu Mountain Villa?

485
00:31:46,279 --> 00:31:47,279
Yes.

486
00:31:47,440 --> 00:31:49,359
But it was pouring last night.

487
00:31:49,920 --> 00:31:52,000
Mr. Ji was too drunk to even walk straight.

488
00:31:52,599 --> 00:31:53,960
But he still insisted on going.

489
00:31:54,720 --> 00:31:56,160
I was afraid something might happen,

490
00:31:56,559 --> 00:31:58,039
so I brought him home instead.

491
00:31:59,759 --> 00:32:00,759
Mr. Shen,

492
00:32:01,079 --> 00:32:03,720
Mr. Ji wasn't angry when
he woke up, was he?

493
00:32:04,680 --> 00:32:05,680
No.

494
00:32:06,240 --> 00:32:07,240
So that's what happened.

495
00:32:08,000 --> 00:32:09,319
He was drunk last night,

496
00:32:10,400 --> 00:32:12,960
and all he could think about
was going to Jinxiu Mountain Villa.

497
00:32:13,440 --> 00:32:14,759
Zhao Yi lives there,

498
00:32:15,559 --> 00:32:16,720
or maybe someone else.

499
00:32:17,559 --> 00:32:19,759
It took him so long to recognize me
after he came back.

500
00:32:21,559 --> 00:32:24,880
So I'm just the fallback
he had no choice but to come back to.
